From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kern0x1b <kern0x1b@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScriptCore: put ARMv7 back into the Yarr JIT

Trunk's Yarr with the ARMv7 register set and code paths restored, so regular
expressions are compiled on this CPU instead of interpreted.
